{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.191.92.116","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80279,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"482a0ee939689f322d83bb0c9c701669","RawContent":"Hey fellow brides, any ladies planning their 2018 wedding? I&#039;ve been engaged for over a year now (shhh I know absolutely ridiculous \ud83d\ude39) I finally started planning and decided on a destination wedding. I&#039;m 99% sure we&#039;re doing Generations Riviera Maya. How everyone&#039;s planning going? Mines gone easy thus far, I was lucky enough to snag a wedding planner who lives in Mexico!! \ud83c\udf89 Hope to hear from some brides who are planning!!\n\n\n-stacey","Attachments":[],"Id":1915492,"PostDate":1472476252,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey fellow brides, any ladies planning their 2018 wedding? I've been engaged for over a year now (shhh I know absolutely ridiculous \ud83d\ude39) I finally started planning and decided on a destination wedding. I'm 99% sure we're doing Generations Riviera Maya. How everyone's planning going? Mines gone easy thus far, I was lucky enough to snag a wedding planner who lives in Mexico!! \ud83c\udf89 Hope to hear from some brides who are planning!!<br><br>\n-stacey\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sambrefe67@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.191.92.116","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1472025960,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287613.jpg?_r=1476350829","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Stacsoontobeegan","Id":287613,"Name":"Stacsoontobeegan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.239.252.157","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80279,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"96922fcc949640c7cf1ec1105d893443","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Stacsoontobeegan\" post=\"1915492\" timestamp=\"1472497852\"]\nHey fellow brides, any ladies planning their 2018 wedding? I&#039;ve been engaged for over a year now (shhh I know absolutely ridiculous ) I finally started planning and decided on a destination wedding. I&#039;m 99% sure we&#039;re doing Generations Riviera Maya. How everyone&#039;s planning going? Mines gone easy thus far, I was lucky enough to snag a wedding planner who lives in Mexico!!  Hope to hear from some brides who are planning!!\n\n-stacey[\/quote]\nI am also a 2018 Bride! My location was set for Now Sapphire but I have a few new locations that has caught my eye. Smh all my fault because I can never make my mind up Lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1915497,"PostDate":1472488707,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Stacsoontobeegan, on 29 August 2016 - 01:10 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey fellow brides, any ladies planning their 2018 wedding? I've been engaged for over a year now (shhh I know absolutely ridiculous ) I finally started planning and decided on a destination wedding. I'm 99% sure we're doing Generations Riviera Maya. How everyone's planning going? Mines gone easy thus far, I was lucky enough to snag a wedding planner who lives in Mexico!!  Hope to hear from some brides who are planning!!<br><br>\n-stacey<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am also a 2018 Bride! My location was set for Now Sapphire but I have a few new locations that has caught my eye. Smh all my fault because I can never make my mind up Lol<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"color:#ffa07a;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\">#ProjectDreamWedding On A Journey To Our Dream Wedding!\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"johnsonspartyof2@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.239.253.193","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1470340511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287511.jpg?_r=1470362394","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Johnsonspartyof2","Id":287511,"Name":"Johnsonspartyof2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"63.173.125.139","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80279,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ec9ff688a5683b13b1412a5b488cbe4","RawContent":"@[member=\"Johnsonspartyof2\"] haha that&#039;s exactly me! I&#039;ve \"decided\" on now four places. That&#039;s why I decided to go the planner route. She&#039;s not affiliated with any resort and can give me her honest opinion. It&#039;s hard choosing when I&#039;m here not there.","Attachments":[],"Id":1915501,"PostDate":1472494272,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287511-johnsonspartyof2\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Johnsonspartyof2<\/span><\/a> haha that's exactly me! I've \"decided\" on now four places. That's why I decided to go the planner route. She's not affiliated with any resort and can give me her honest opinion. It's hard choosing when I'm here not there. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sambrefe67@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.191.92.116","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1472025960,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287613.jpg?_r=1476350829","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Stacsoontobeegan","Id":287613,"Name":"Stacsoontobeegan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.149.194.216","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80279,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc6e7be80ae73ae825272a6873ffdeb3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, Stacey and Congrats on your engagement and upcoming destination wedding in 2018!!! You&#039;ll find lots of great resources here to help with your planning questions, and if you&#039;ve already decided on your venue, that&#039;s a BIG piece of your planning in place already, so well done!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s what the Generations Riviera Maya looks like as a backdrop for wedding photos, as shown in these magical wedding moments that matter we captured there.....enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/02\/12\/Generations-Riviera-Maya-Wedding&#039;&gt;Generations Riviera Maya Wedding Story Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_5207e85f5d124be4ac82c13c29ac371d.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_5207e85f5d124be4ac82c13c29ac371d.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_5207e85f5d124be4ac82c13c29ac371d.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....and these from a combo wedding at both the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/04\/29\/El-Dorado-Generations-Combination-Wedding-Day&#039;&gt;El Dorado &amp;amp; Generation Riviera Maya Wedding Story Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_f1b20e2c98e240c99fee6476591fc7a2~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_f1b20e2c98e240c99fee6476591fc7a2~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_f1b20e2c98e240c99fee6476591fc7a2~\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_d2fc706ffedd4bfc8d5012f895b1ad85~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_d2fc706ffedd4bfc8d5012f895b1ad85~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_d2fc706ffedd4bfc8d5012f895b1ad85~\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and that you completely keep on Enjoying your amazing journey ahead - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915507,"PostDate":1472558818,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, Stacey and Congrats on your engagement and upcoming destination wedding in 2018!!! You'll find lots of great resources here to help with your planning questions, and if you've already decided on your venue, that's a BIG piece of your planning in place already, so well done!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's what the Generations Riviera Maya looks like as a backdrop for wedding photos, as shown in these magical wedding moments that matter we captured there.....enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>Taken from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/02\/12\/Generations-Riviera-Maya-Wedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Generations Riviera Maya Wedding Story Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_5207e85f5d124be4ac82c13c29ac371d.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_5207e85f5d124be4ac82c13c29ac371d.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_5207e85f5d124be4ac82c13c29ac371d.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....and these from a combo wedding at both the <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/04\/29\/El-Dorado-Generations-Combination-Wedding-Day' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>El Dorado & Generation Riviera Maya Wedding Story Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_f1b20e2c98e240c99fee6476591fc7a2~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_f1b20e2c98e240c99fee6476591fc7a2~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_f1b20e2c98e240c99fee6476591fc7a2~\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_d2fc706ffedd4bfc8d5012f895b1ad85~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_d2fc706ffedd4bfc8d5012f895b1ad85~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_d2fc706ffedd4bfc8d5012f895b1ad85~\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and that you completely keep on Enjoying your amazing journey ahead - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280189060,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80279,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6d626e566fb30e9eefc5e13bf935183a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;Hi @[member=\"Stacsoontobeegan\"]&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;Congratulations on making the decision to have a destination wedding, we are sure that is going to be an even more memorable experience this way since you will have more time to connect with family and friends. Luckily you have a wedding planner so you can leave things in her hands to arrange things properly.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;We also create destination weddings on an amazing natural location that calls for a relax ambiance, doing the planning long distance allowing the couple to enjoy the whole experience along with their guests. Here are a few pictures of what couples get to enjoy at our venue, &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff5050;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;Las Caletas&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;, a &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff5050;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;private beach&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt; in Puerto Vallarta where guests arrive &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff5050;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;by sea only&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:garamond, serif;\"&gt;\u2026&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83503]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:84708]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:84689]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83226]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915522,"PostDate":1472642711,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\">Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287613\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287613-stacsoontobeegan\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Stacsoontobeegan<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\">Congratulations on making the decision to have a destination wedding, we are sure that is going to be an even more memorable experience this way since you will have more time to connect with family and friends. Luckily you have a wedding planner so you can leave things in her hands to arrange things properly.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\">We also create destination weddings on an amazing natural location that calls for a relax ambiance, doing the planning long distance allowing the couple to enjoy the whole experience along with their guests. Here are a few pictures of what couples get to enjoy at our venue, <\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"color:#ff5050\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\">Las Caletas<\/span><\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\">, a <\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"color:#ff5050\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\">private beach<\/span><\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\"> in Puerto Vallarta where guests arrive <\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"color:#ff5050\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\">by sea only<\/span><\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"color:#595959\"><span  style=\"font-family:garamond, serif\">\u2026<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/83503-destination-wedding-las-caletas-puerto-vallarta\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18165\/sml_gallery_258213_18165_1418248.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Destination wedding, Las Caletas Puerto Vallarta'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Destination wedding, Las Caletas Puerto Vallarta' id='sml_image_view_83503' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/84708-candles-enhance-the-romantic-atmosphere-of-las-caletas\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_761978.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='candles enhance the romantic atmosphere of Las Caletas'  width='200' height='134'  alt='candles enhance the romantic atmosphere of Las Caletas' id='sml_image_view_84708' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/84689-irregular-design-wedding-cake\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18217\/sml_gallery_258213_18217_152760.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='irregular design wedding cake'  width='200' height='134'  alt='irregular design wedding cake' id='sml_image_view_84689' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/83226-cd-020216-73\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18074\/sml_gallery_258213_18074_3929440.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='C&D 020216 73'  width='200' height='132'  alt='C&D 020216 73' id='sml_image_view_83226' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.adventure...gsvallarta.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343037203,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpg?_r=1475871220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.153.92.74","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80279,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e13455baca9c7957342a3b7766bd876f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hola @[member=\"Stacsoontobeegan\"] We also want to say a big congratulations on your upcoming wedding. 2018 will be here before you know it!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As many of the other vendors have mentioned BDW.com is your best resource for planning your perfect destination wedding. Please let us know if you have any questions at all and we would be more than happy to help to the best of our ability. Feel free to PM us any time! &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ll leave you with some inspiration&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915523,"PostDate":1472658697,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hola @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287613\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287613-stacsoontobeegan\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Stacsoontobeegan<\/span><\/a> We also want to say a big congratulations on your upcoming wedding. 2018 will be here before you know it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>As many of the other vendors have mentioned BDW.com is your best resource for planning your perfect destination wedding. Please let us know if you have any questions at all and we would be more than happy to help to the best of our ability. Feel free to PM us any time! <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We'll leave you with some inspiration<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1915523]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-66164500-1472680257.jpg\" title=\"Kristen_Michael_Teaser_22.jpg -  74.67KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-66164500-1472680257.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Kristen_Michael_Teaser_22.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1915523]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-33567600-1472680267.jpg\" title=\"Jessica_Brennan_Teaser_03.jpg -  58.17KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-33567600-1472680267.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Jessica_Brennan_Teaser_03.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1915523]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-34595000-1472680284.jpg\" title=\"Maribel_Leo_Teaser_01.jpg -  123.72KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-34595000-1472680284.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Maribel_Leo_Teaser_01.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1915523]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-95602900-1472680293.jpg\" title=\"Heather_Josue_Teaser_07.jpg -  50.18KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2016\/post-287055-0-95602900-1472680293.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Heather_Josue_Teaser_07.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Jasmin & Matt - Breathtaking Destination Wedding & Lifestyle Photography<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\">\u00a0rating on <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/reviews'>Facebook<\/a> & <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21784-jasmin-matt-photography\/'>BestDestinationWedding.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Still not convinced? Read our <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/info\/testimonials\/'>testimonials of appreciation from previous couples <3<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<a><span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\">+52-1-984-114-3386<\/span><\/a><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Ask us how we can help you plan your perfect wedding day.<\/span><\/span>","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464774339,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.28.97.157","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80279,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c66d4702c61476b82a0642775e9ded55","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"Stacsoontobeegan\"] !&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My SO and I are planning a 2018 destination wedding also and are looking in the same areas! We are planning a site visit to the Cancun\/Playa Del Carmen area in November and will be visiting Generations Riviera Maya as that is on our list as well. Keep in touch and I&#039;ll share pictures\/reviews when I go.. we are also looking at Hyatt Ziva Cancun, Beach Palace, Azul Beach, and Secrets Maroma.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Best of Luck!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;M&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1915528,"PostDate":1472719324,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287613\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287613-stacsoontobeegan\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Stacsoontobeegan<\/span><\/a> !<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My SO and I are planning a 2018 destination wedding also and are looking in the same areas! We are planning a site visit to the Cancun\/Playa Del Carmen area in November and will be visiting Generations Riviera Maya as that is on our list as well. Keep in touch and I'll share pictures\/reviews when I go.. we are also looking at Hyatt Ziva Cancun, Beach Palace, Azul Beach, and Secrets Maroma.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Best of Luck!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>M<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megan.higgins512@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.171.135.170","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1471987317,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287610.jpg?_r=1472011295","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"motevoli","Id":287610,"Name":"motevoli","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"120.16.206.161","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80279,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a6bdf156adfacef8e6106a55f1656980","RawContent":"2018 seems so far away but when you have to plan a wedding.. It&#039;s not too far away!\n\n\nI&#039;m planning on a July wedding in Thailand in 2018! So excited. struggling to find some information on wedding planners though.","Attachments":[],"Id":1915536,"PostDate":1472773870,"PostCont