el Sol is beautiful! But you need a wedding planner. I was looking at Cabo Del Sol and Sunset Mona Lisa!&amp;nbsp; And both need a wedding planner.... So just to throw some helpful info out there you may want to look into &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.cabobechweddings.com\"&gt;www.CaboBeachWeddings.com &lt;\/a&gt;or &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.asunsetwedding.com\"&gt;www.asunsetwedding.com&lt;\/a&gt; both of these wedding planning services have been very helpful and are reasonably priced!&amp;nbsp; I just sign with Cabo Beach Weddings, Christina Mattos is our wedding planer. She has been on the ball with everything!!! &lt;img alt=\":mswink:\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msnwink.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1803788,"PostDate":1380491029,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Cabo Del Sol is beautiful! But you need a wedding planner. I was looking at Cabo Del Sol and Sunset Mona Lisa!\u00a0 And both need a wedding planner.... So just to throw some helpful info out there you may want to look into <a href='http:\/\/www.cabobechweddings.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.CaboBeachWeddings.com <\/a>or <a href='http:\/\/www.asunsetwedding.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.asunsetwedding.com<\/a> both of these wedding planning services have been very helpful and are reasonably priced!\u00a0 I just sign with Cabo Beach Weddings, Christina Mattos is our wedding planer. She has been on the ball with everything!!! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\":mswink:\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msnwink.gif\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"casademattos@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"189.176.191.114","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1376073333,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272421.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cabobeachbride","Id":272421,"Name":"cabobeachbride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72412,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bdd97f60a6df113acbaded3431aeccfa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hola everyone I was look at cabo del sol online and had no idea I needed to bring in my own wedding planner.... OMG! So Thank CaboBeachBride for the heads up! I will be looking into the ones you suggested&lt;img alt=\":cheers:\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheers.gif\" \/&gt; Cheers!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1803794,"PostDate":1380491831,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hola everyone I was look at cabo del sol online and had no idea I needed to bring in my own wedding planner.... OMG! So Thank CaboBeachBride for the heads up! I will be looking into the ones you suggested<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\":cheers:\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheers.gif\" \/><\/span> Cheers!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"casademattos@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380491309,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273875.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"2014Mexibride","Id":273875,"Name":"2014Mexibride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72412,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"540ee1add7598b3f7b5c3fcc89b70c6d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;did you decide on cabo del sol? if so how has your planning process been? and what packages &amp;amp; prices did they provide you with? We wil be getting married october 2014, staying at sheraton hacienda, trying to decide between having ceremony at the sheraton or cabo del sol:) any insight??? Thank you so much!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Linsay&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1804803,"PostDate":1380876903,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi!<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>did you decide on cabo del sol? if so how has your planning process been? and what packages & prices did they provide you with? We wil be getting married october 2014, staying at sheraton hacienda, trying to decide between having ceremony at the sheraton or cabo del sol:) any insight??? Thank you so much!!<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Linsay<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lgillum03@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"68.48.238.219","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1379617668,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273617.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"linsay","Id":273617,"Name":"linsay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72412,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b7ec3cfe9a7b9cb90dd7cd2f100353c8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have a wonderful wedding planner in Cabo who has come very highly recommended (I am meeting her in person next month). Would be happy to pass on her info if anyone is interested.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1806613,"PostDate":1381422662,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have a wonderful wedding planner in Cabo who has come very highly recommended (I am meeting her in person next month). Would be happy to pass on her info if anyone is interested.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marina.rozhansky@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381422283,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274147.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marina309","Id":274147,"Name":"Marina309","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72412,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"910774845b48a3f1a8f5a0db3feee7f2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Ok we decided and Cabo Del Sol it is!!! &lt;img alt=\":smile159:\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" \/&gt; Sheraton is too much of a hotel feel for us and Cabo Del Sol just seems to have so much more options.&amp;nbsp; Plus Luz their event planner gave us some great prices for having our wedding during the week instead of the weekend.&amp;nbsp; We are going to do our rehearsal dinner at the Sheraton though! right down on the beach. Right now I&#039;m talking with a coordinator at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.cabobechweddings.com\/\"&gt;www.CaboBeachWeddings.com&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/a&gt;and she has been very responsive! Thanks for the heads-up &lt;span class=\"huddler-mention\"&gt;@&lt;\/span&gt;cabobeachbride&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Good luck Linsay and let me know if you have any questions about cabo del sol.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1806681,"PostDate":1381481373,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Ok we decided and Cabo Del Sol it is!!! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\":smile159:\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" \/><\/span> Sheraton is too much of a hotel feel for us and Cabo Del Sol just seems to have so much more options.\u00a0 Plus Luz their event planner gave us some great prices for having our wedding during the week instead of the weekend.\u00a0 We are going to do our rehearsal dinner at the Sheraton though! right down on the beach. Right now I'm talking with a coordinator at <a href='http:\/\/www.cabobechweddings.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.CaboBeachWeddings.com\u00a0 <\/a>and she has been very responsive! Thanks for the heads-up <span class=\"huddler-mention\">@<\/span>cabobeachbride<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Good luck Linsay and let me know if you have any questions about cabo del sol.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"casademattos@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1380491309,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273875.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"2014Mexibride","Id":273875,"Name":"2014Mexibride","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":20,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
