> User Msing (288394)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.175.20.181","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80021,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4121f8c2ea61f9b32dadf43411789118","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I didn&#039;t see a thread started for brides getting married at the Royalton Riviera Cancun in 2016\/2017 so I figured I would start one!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I figured this would be a great way for each other to compare notes, and answer each others questions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m just finalizing booking with Luxe Weddings and am planning on booking the Royalton Riviera Cancun for May 2017!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m looking at either getting married on the beach, or the Sky Deck, followed by a reception at the Nautica Beach Bar, or directly on the beach!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What are you guys doing??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912352,"PostDate":1459368575,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I didn't see a thread started for brides getting married at the Royalton Riviera Cancun in 2016\/2017 so I figured I would start one!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I figured this would be a great way for each other to compare notes, and answer each others questions.\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>I'm just finalizing booking with Luxe Weddings and am planning on booking the Royalton Riviera Cancun for May 2017!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm looking at either getting married on the beach, or the Sky Deck, followed by a reception at the Nautica Beach Bar, or directly on the beach!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What are you guys doing??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melanderic2017@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.175.20.181","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1458758097,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286553.jpg?_r=1459026376","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"melanderic2017","Id":286553,"Name":"melanderic2017","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.41.28","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80021,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d27391185574fa07120164f1a818f686","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@melanderic2017&amp;nbsp; Congrats on planning your DW! There was a bride that was married there just this past October. You could have a look through her thread and see if there is anything there that will help you out. It&#039;s not that long ago and that resort hasn&#039;t been open very long so all of the info will be pretty recent. I started the thread below when I first found the resort but it has been added to quite a bit. It&#039;s worth a read.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76750-new-resort-royalton-riviera-cancun\/page-12&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76750-new-resort-royalton-riviera-cancun\/page-12&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912357,"PostDate":1459372362,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@melanderic2017\u00a0 Congrats on planning your DW! There was a bride that was married there just this past October. You could have a look through her thread and see if there is anything there that will help you out. It's not that long ago and that resort hasn't been open very long so all of the info will be pretty recent. I started the thread below when I first found the resort but it has been added to quite a bit. It's worth a read.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76750-new-resort-royalton-riviera-cancun\/page-12' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...-cancun\/page-12<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;484\/st\/20111020\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/6168\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283437399,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.90.218.120","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80021,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e2f3d16364d7c4776edd906f1d711f4c","RawContent":"Hey Mel!\n\nThank you for this. my wedding is booked for January 2017. I am planning on having the ceremony in the chapel and reception on the terrace, but our guest count is increasing so I am thinking maybe switching the ceremony to the terrace and having the reception inside one of the ballrooms. We are going to do a site visit next month which includes a tour and menu tastings, I&#039;m sure we&#039;ll know by then. \n\nI posted on the last thread about a week ago and no one responded so I guess that thread died out. My question was for the brides who already had their weddings there though. I was wondering about budgets and any surprise\/hidden fees.","Attachments":[],"Id":1912379,"PostDate":1459430340,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey Mel!<br>\nThank you for this. my wedding is booked for January 2017. I am planning on having the ceremony in the chapel and reception on the terrace, but our guest count is increasing so I am thinking maybe switching the ceremony to the terrace and having the reception inside one of the ballrooms. We are going to do a site visit next month which includes a tour and menu tastings, I'm sure we'll know by then. <br>\nI posted on the last thread about a week ago and no one responded so I guess that thread died out. My question was for the brides who already had their weddings there though. I was wondering about budgets and any surprise\/hidden fees.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"laurenandjason2017@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.90.218.120","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1454537922,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Laur114","Id":286128,"Name":"Laur114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.235.119.234","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80021,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d55296dbac45c7f09ec542a712cd5fd","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Laur114\" post=\"1912379\" timestamp=\"1459451940\"]\nHey Mel!\nThank you for this. my wedding is booked for January 2017. I am planning on having the ceremony in the chapel and reception on the terrace, but our guest count is increasing so I am thinking maybe switching the ceremony to the terrace and having the reception inside one of the ballrooms. We are going to do a site visit next month which includes a tour and menu tastings, I&#039;m sure we&#039;ll know by then.\nI posted on the last thread about a week ago and no one responded so I guess that thread died out. My question was for the brides who already had their weddings there though. I was wondering about budgets and any surprise\/hidden fees.[\/quote]That sounds awesome Laur! Let me know what feedback you get when you go in a couple of weeks! I&#039;d love to  hear :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1912380,"PostDate":1459431213,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Laur114, on 31 March 2016 - 01:19 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey Mel!<br>\nThank you for this. my wedding is booked for January 2017. I am planning on having the ceremony in the chapel and reception on the terrace, but our guest count is increasing so I am thinking maybe switching the ceremony to the terrace and having the reception inside one of the ballrooms. We are going to do a site visit next month which includes a tour and menu tastings, I'm sure we'll know by then.<br>\nI posted on the last thread about a week ago and no one responded so I guess that thread died out. My question was for the brides who already had their weddings there though. I was wondering about budgets and any surprise\/hidden fees.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>That sounds awesome Laur! Let me know what feedback you get when you go in a couple of weeks! I'd love to\u00a0 hear <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melanderic2017@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.175.20.181","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1458758097,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286553.jpg?_r=1459026376","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"melanderic2017","Id":286553,"Name":"melanderic2017","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.66.4.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80021,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f965a4d92c3e151511008a1ccb0326f9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, and Congrats on your Jan wedding at the Royalton Riviera Cancun!!! You&#039;re sure to find lots of great resources here to answer your planning questions, so well done on a wonderful start already :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We wish you happy research and that your find what you&#039;re looking for - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_b455600acaad4ee8824a7ad97a766eec.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_b455600acaad4ee8824a7ad97a766eec.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_b455600acaad4ee8824a7ad97a766eec.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912626,"PostDate":1459948146,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, and Congrats on your Jan wedding at the Royalton Riviera Cancun!!! You're sure to find lots of great resources here to answer your planning questions, so well done on a wonderful start already <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We wish you happy research and that your find what you're looking for - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_b455600acaad4ee8824a7ad97a766eec.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_b455600acaad4ee8824a7ad97a766eec.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_b455600acaad4ee8824a7ad97a766eec.\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280189060,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"195.59.193.132","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80021,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e628facc27475d80bba6e73e704571ff","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Have you managed to book your wedding date in May 2017 yet??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have booked our accommodation but currently awaiting confirmation from our Travel Agent of our confirmation wedding date. We have also booked in May 2017 too??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Looking at either getting married on the beach or chapel and then a reception on the beach or the beach bar.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Would be fab to know how you are getting on??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;xx&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913269,"PostDate":1462254196,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you managed to book your wedding date in May 2017 yet??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have booked our accommodation but currently awaiting confirmation from our Travel Agent of our confirmation wedding date. We have also booked in May 2017 too??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Looking at either getting married on the beach or chapel and then a reception on the beach or the beach bar.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Would be fab to know how you are getting on??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>xx<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lauren_gray_89@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"195.59.193.132","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1462253905,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ljgray1989","Id":286862,"Name":"ljgray1989","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.235.119.234","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80021,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"34200836d5b4ac1e3282805427c40b56","RawContent":"[quote name=\"ljgray1989\" post=\"1913269\" timestamp=\"1462275796\"]\nHi,\n\nHave you managed to book your wedding date in May 2017 yet??\n\nI have booked our accommodation but currently awaiting confirmation from our Travel Agent of our confirmation wedding date. We have also booked in May 2017 too??\n\nLooking at either getting married on the beach or chapel and then a reception on the beach or the beach bar.\n\nWould be fab to know how you are getting on??\n\nxx[\/quote]Hey LJGray,\n\nI have officially booked my wedding date of May 9th, 2017! We&#039;ll be leaving Montreal and Toronto on May 6th, and returning on May 13th  :)\n\nI booked my wedding directly with Luxe Destination Weddings so they&#039;ve been pretty much holding the reigns of the planning, which I love, since I plan weddings for a living. I want someone to take care of it for me!!\n\nWe&#039;re likely doing a beach wedding, followed by a reception at the Nautica Beach Bar. I can&#039;t seem to find many pictures of a dinner\/dance type of setup at the beach bar but I&#039;ve been stalking instagram and facebook for other brides pictures haha.\nLet me know if you find anything!!\n\nOther than that, I get to start planning the actual wedding details starting on Monday, when I have the first phone call with the actual \"wedding planner\" from Luxe. I&#039;ve only been dealing with a travel agent so far, who helped me pick the venue.\n\nWhere are you leaving from? Do you have dates decided yet? Looking forward to the journey, feel free to reach out with any questions or your feedback too.","Attachments":[],"Id":1913292,"PostDate":1462287938,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>ljgray1989, on 03 May 2016 - 05:43 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you managed to book your wedding date in May 2017 yet??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have booked our accommodation but currently awaiting confirmation from our Travel Agent of our confirmation wedding date. We have also booked in May 2017 too??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Looking at either getting married on the beach or chapel and then a reception on the beach or the beach bar.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Would be fab to know how you are getting on??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>xx<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hey LJGray,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have officially booked my wedding date of May 9th, 2017! We'll be leaving Montreal and Toronto on May 6th, and returning on May 13th\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nI booked my wedding directly with Luxe Destination Weddings so they've been pretty much holding the reigns of the planning, which I love, since I plan weddings for a living. I want someone to take care of it for me!!<br><br>\nWe're likely doing a beach wedding, followed by a reception at the Nautica Beach Bar. I can't seem to find many pictures of a dinner\/dance type of setup at the beach bar but I've been stalking instagram and facebook for other brides pictures haha.<br>\nLet me know if you find anything!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Other than that, I get to start planning the actual wedding details starting on Monday, when I have the first phone call with the actual \"wedding planner\" from Luxe. I've only been dealing with a travel agent so far, who helped me pick the venue.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Where are you leaving from? Do you have dates decided yet? Looking forward to the journey, feel free to reach out with any questions or your feedback too.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melanderic2017@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.175.20.181","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1458758097,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286553.jpg?_r=1459026376","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"melanderic2017","Id":286553,"Name":"melanderic2017","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"195.59.193.132","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80021,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b7535558a071b72da626e819748226cf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m glad I&#039;ve found someone else who is getting married there the same month :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are flying from London Stansted on 17th May, so we wont be there the same time. We have booked through a british travel agent who is dealing with the wedding as they have a weddings team. I have been told I may have to wait up to 8 weeks to have the date confirmed. Did you get the date you wanted?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Are you having a civil ceremony? As I&#039;ve been told you need to be there 3 business days before not including date of arrival.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m torn between the beach wedding or having it in the Chapel. I&#039;ve been stalking the internet for photographers websites who have posted peoples wedding pics online. I was initially put off by the beach as friends have said that your surrounded by sunbathers but the pictures I&#039;ve seen of the weddings at this hotel it looks a bit more private. Where have you found pictures??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve had some correspondence direct with the hotel, they sent me through all of the information available. All the pricelists and everything :) Let me know if you want anything and how your planning is going also :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;xx&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913304,"PostDate":1462339219,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm glad I've found someone else who is getting married there the same month <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are flying from London Stansted on 17th May, so we wont be there the same time. We have booked through a british travel agent who is dealing with the wedding as they have a weddings team. I have been told I may have to wait up to 8 weeks to have the date confirmed. Did you get the date you wanted?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are you having a civil ceremony? As I've been told you need to be there 3 business days before not including date of arrival.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm torn between the beach wedding or having it in the Chapel. I've been stalking the internet for photographers websites who have posted peoples wedding pics online. I was initially put off by the beach as friends have said that your surrounded by sunbathers but the pictures I've seen of the weddings at this hotel it looks a bit more private. Where have you found pictures??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've had some correspondence direct with the hotel, they sent me through all of the information available. All the pricelists and everything <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Let me know if you want anything and how your planning is going also <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>xx<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lauren_gray_89@hotmail.co.uk","IpAddress":"195.59.193.132","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1462253905,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ljgray1989","Id":286862,"Name":"ljgray1989","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.192.76.178","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80021,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3f9913ce8f1ee35465aa7767181d2518","RawContent":"[quote name=\"melanderic2017\" post=\"1913292\" timestamp=\"1462309538\"]\nHey LJGray,\n\nI have officially booked my wedding date of May 9th, 2017! We&#039;ll be leaving Montreal and Toronto on May 6th, and returning on May 13th  :)\n\nI booked my wedding directly with Luxe Destination Weddings so they&#039;ve been pretty much holding the reigns of the planning, which I love, since I plan weddings for a living. I want someone to take care of it for me!!\n\nWe&#039;re likely doing a beach wedding, followed by a reception at the Nautica Beach Bar. I can&#039;t seem to find many pictures of a dinner\/dance type of setup at the beach bar but I&#039;ve been stalking instagram and facebook for other brides pictures haha.\nLet me know if you find anything!!\n\nOther than that, I get to start planning the actual wedding details starting on Monday, when I have the first phone call with the actual \"wedding planner\" from Luxe. I&#039;ve only been dealing with a travel agent so far, who helped me pick the venue.\n\nWhere are you leaving from? Do you have dates decided yet? Looking forward to the journey, feel free to reach out with any questions or your feedback too.[\/quote]\nI&#039;m considering doing the same line up - beach ceremony and reception at the beach bar. How much was the location fees for the beach and beach bar? You have to pay the location fee plus the per person private dinner menu plus any decor\/setup right?\nI think the beach bar would look beautiful with some string lights over head and some long farmer tables depending on how many people you&#039;re expecting - or at least that&#039;s my vision haha!  :D","Attachments":[],"Id":1913321,"PostDate":1462361783,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>melanderic2017, on 03 May 2016 - 03:05 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hey LJGray,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have officially booked my wedding date of May 9th, 2017! We'll be leaving Montreal and Toronto on May 6th, and returning on May 13th\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nI booked my wedding directly with Luxe Destination Weddings so they've been pretty much holding the reigns of the planning, which I love, since I plan weddings for a living. I want someone to take care of it for me!!<br><br>\nWe're likely doing a beach wedding, followed by a reception at the Nautica Beach Bar. I can't seem to find many pictures of a dinner\/dance type of setup at the beach bar but I've been stalking instagram and facebook for other brides pictures haha.<br>\nLet me know if you find anything!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Other than that, I get to start planning the actual wedding details starting on Monday, when I have the first phone call with the actual \"wedding planner\" from Luxe. I've only been dealing with a travel agent so far, who helped me pick the venue.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Where are you leaving from? Do you have dates decided yet? Looking forward to the journey, feel free to reach out with any questions or your feedback too.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm considering doing the same line up - beach ceremony and reception at the beach bar. How much was the location fees for the beach and beach bar? You have to pay the location fee plus the per person private dinner menu plus any decor\/setup right?<\/p>\n<p>I think the beach bar would look beautiful with some string lights over head and some long farmer tables depending on how many people you're expecting - or at least that's my vision haha!\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sashlozada@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.192.76.178","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1462338809,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286871.jpg?_r=1462360488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sashloz","Id":286871,"Name":"sashloz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.235.119.234","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80021,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ae2aadf6af984f790301e1e04fefda57","RawContent":"[quote name=\"ljgray1989\" post=\"1913304\" timestamp=\"1462360819\"]\nHi,\n\nI&#039;m glad I&#039;ve found someone else who is getting married there the same month :)\n\nWe are flying from London Stansted on 17th May, so we wont be there the same time. We have booked through a british travel agent who is dealing with the wedding as they have a weddings team. I have been told I may have to wait up to 8 weeks to have the date confirmed. Did you get the date you wanted?\n\nAre you having a civil ceremony? As I&#039;ve been told you need to be there 3 business days before not including date of arrival.\n\nI&#039;m torn between the beach wedding or having it in the Chapel. I&#039;ve been stalking the internet for photographers websites who have posted peoples wedding pics online. I was initially put off by the beach as friends have said that your surrounded by sunbathers but the pictures I&#039;ve seen of the weddings at this hotel it looks a bit more private. Where have you found pictures??\n\nI&#039;ve had some correspondence direct with the hotel, they sent me through all of the information available. All the pricelists and everything :) Let me know if you want anything and how your planning is going also :)\n\nxx[\/quote]\nI&#039;ve had some luck finding some pictures with some google searches of the beach setups. I&#039;ll be talking to my planner about putting me in the most secluded location of the beach! It looks like this resort&#039;s beach is vast, and since there&#039;s no neighbouring resorts, as well as they put the location pretty close to the water, so you don&#039;t have people walking right behind your wedding ceremony (that would be the worst...)\n\nI&#039;m also just doing a symbolic ceremony. I don&#039;t want to deal with all of this blood work they ask for. Not my idea of a great start to a vacation lol. I&#039;ve found a few pictures from another bride on this website, and instagram had a couple. Search #RoyaltonRivieraCancun or #royaltonriviera or #royaltoncancun ... You can also search under \"places\" in instagram and look for the resort name! I&#039;ve also just done some general google searching.\n\nI&#039;ve got all the price-lists now which is awesome!! I&#039;ll let you know if there&#039;s anything I want to double check too. Vice Versa :)\n[quote name=\"sashloz\" post=\"1913321\" timestamp=\"1462383383\"]\nI&#039;m considering doing the same line up - beach ceremony and reception at the beach bar. How much was the location fees for the beach and beach bar? You have to pay the location fee plus the per person private dinner menu plus any decor\/setup right?\nI think the beach bar would look beautiful with some string lights over head and some long farmer tables depending on how many people you&#039;re expecting - or at least that&#039;s my vision haha!  :D[\/quote]\nHey!! You don&#039;t have to pay extra for a beach ceremony at all actually. For the beach bar, all you&#039;re paying for is the per-person private dinner fee, which includes 3 hours of open bar. Additional fee applies to extend your open bar which the latest it can be open is 11pm. (I&#039;m opting for a 7pm reception, and extending the open bar for 1 more hour, so it goes to 11). The only extra fees for the venue would be the Sky Deck. I believe its $1500USD right now.\n\nString lights would be gorgeous. I like round tables for seating, with a nice head table. We&#039;re expecting about 40 I think :) I&#039;m planning on a Dark Greyish Navy colour, with dark coral pink and some yellow accents for my wedding colours!","Attachments":[],"Id":1913328,"PostDate":1462378011,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>ljgray1989, on 04 May 2016 - 05:20 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm glad I've found someone else who is getting married there the same month <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are flying from London Stansted on 17th May, so we wont be there the same time. We have booked through a british travel agent who is dealing with the wedding as they have a weddings team. I have been told I may have to wait up to 8 weeks to have the date confirmed. Did you get the date you wanted?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are you having a civil ceremony? As I've been told you need to be there 3 business days before not including date of arrival.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm torn between the beach wedding or having it in the Chapel. I've been stalking the internet for photographers websites who have posted peoples wedding pics online. I was initially put off by the beach as friends have said that your surrounded by sunbathers but the pictures I've seen of the weddings at this hotel it looks a bit more private. Where have you found pictures??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've had some correspondence direct with the hotel, they sent me through all of the information available. All the pricelists and everything <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Let me know if you want anything and how your planning is going also <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>xx<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've had some luck finding some pictures with some google searches of the beach setups. I'll be talking to my planner about putting me in the most secluded location of the beach! It looks like this resort's beach is vast, and since there's no neighbouring resorts, as well as they put the location pretty close to the water, so you don't have people walking right behind your wedding ceremony (that would be the worst...)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm also just doing a symbolic ceremony. I don't want to deal with all of this blood work they ask for. Not my idea of a great start to a vacation lol. I've found a few pictures from another bride on this website, and instagram had a couple. Search #RoyaltonRivieraCancun or #royaltonriviera or #royaltoncancun ... You can also search under \"places\" in instagram and look for the resort name! I've also just done some general google searching.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've got all the price-lists now which is awesome!! I'll let you know if there's anything I want to double check too. Vice Versa <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>sashloz, on 04 May 2016 - 11:36 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I'm considering doing the same line up - beach ceremony and reception at the beach bar. How much was the location fees for the beach and beach bar? You have to pay the location fee plus the per person private dinner menu plus any decor\/setup right?<\/p>\n<p>I think the beach bar would look beautiful with some string lights over head and some long farmer tables depending on how many people you're expecting - or at least that's my vision haha!\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hey!! You don't have to pay extra for a beach ceremony at all actually. For the beach bar, all you're paying for is the per-person private dinner fee, which includes 3 hours of open bar. Additional fee applies to extend your open bar which the latest it can be open is 11pm. (I'm opting for a 7pm reception, and extending the open bar for 1 more hour, so it goes to 11). The only extra fees for the venue would be the Sky Deck. I believe its $1500USD right now.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>String lights would be gorgeous. I like round tables for seating, with a nice head table. We're expecting about 40 I think <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I'm planning on a Dark Greyish Navy colour, with dark coral pink and some yellow accents for my wedding colours!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melanderic2017@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.175.20.181","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1458758097,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286553.jpg?_r=1459026376","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"melanderic2017","Id":286553,"Name":"melanderic2017","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":106,"TotalPages":11,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":100},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
