Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.78.49","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80114,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"324b9131c898e3403e8ca1038693f4be","RawContent":"I am in the process of confirming my Feb 2017 wedding at Sandos Finisterra and wonder if anyone out there has recently have their wedding there or are sometime soon. I don&#039;t have time or budget to do site visits and hoping with this forum and gut feeling things well go well.  Let&#039;s become best friends!","Attachments":[],"Id":1914122,"PostDate":1464796380,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am in the process of confirming my Feb 2017 wedding at Sandos Finisterra and wonder if anyone out there has recently have their wedding there or are sometime soon. I don't have time or budget to do site visits and hoping with this forum and gut feeling things well go well.  Let's become best friends!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"heathermlarkin@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.87.78.137","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1462529748,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"hstuck","Id":286891,"Name":"hstuck","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.223.113.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80114,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb958bc00b38d3f6c7bfa8733d423d63","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m getting married at Sandos Finisterra in November 2016. &amp;nbsp;We went to visit last November so I&#039;m happy to try to answer any questions you might have about the venue. &amp;nbsp;I met with Lupita (the resort&#039;s wedding coordinator) while I was there and she was very nice and answered all of my questions. &amp;nbsp;She explained there are 3 locations for the wedding reception and we choose the Tortuga Deck which is right on the sand. &amp;nbsp;However, that only holds 60 people &amp;nbsp;and it looks like we will exceed that so most likely we will be having it on the Mountain Top Terrace which looks beautiful in pictures but I&#039;m bummed we didn&#039;t see it while visiting. &amp;nbsp;It also comes with an extra $750 charge.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anyways, let me know if you have any questions and hopefully I can help!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914445,"PostDate":1466179322,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi! \u00a0I'm getting married at Sandos Finisterra in November 2016. \u00a0We went to visit last November so I'm happy to try to answer any questions you might have about the venue. \u00a0I met with Lupita (the resort's wedding coordinator) while I was there and she was very nice and answered all of my questions. \u00a0She explained there are 3 locations for the wedding reception and we choose the Tortuga Deck which is right on the sand. \u00a0However, that only holds 60 people \u00a0and it looks like we will exceed that so most likely we will be having it on the Mountain Top Terrace which looks beautiful in pictures but I'm bummed we didn't see it while visiting. \u00a0It also comes with an extra $750 charge.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyways, let me know if you have any questions and hopefully I can help!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sdevore138@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"209.242.148.242","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1450109704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285591.jpg?_r=1466200976","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sdevore138","Id":285591,"Name":"Sdevore138","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.212.90.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80114,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0452d86ea744672f69da583322d653cf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"Sdevore138\"] I have sooooo many questions! I loved Sandos but I couldn&#039;t find much information. Do you have a brochure with pricing and per person info?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re looking for adults only, were there a lot of kids around?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914492,"PostDate":1466503680,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285591\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285591-sdevore138\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Sdevore138<\/span><\/a> I have sooooo many questions! I loved Sandos but I couldn't find much information. Do you have a brochure with pricing and per person info?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're looking for adults only, were there a lot of kids around?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bmillerick@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.153.133.73","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1464601988,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287040.jpg?_r=1465126901","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bmillerick","Id":287040,"Name":"bmillerick","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.14.72.31","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80114,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"99d605116f27d811bb0cc0f736d0d619","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My experience with all inclusive hotels is that they have an area for just kiddos and an adult area. If the coordinator can talk a walk and have a face time conversation with you to ease your mind that would be the way to go (like my run on sentence)?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Brides that book a place such as these can enjoy the best of both worlds: They can have family who has kiddos enjoy the just for kids \/ families area while knowing they have an adult only bar or pool area they can relax in while kids are not splashing them. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914648,"PostDate":1467639401,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My experience with all inclusive hotels is that they have an area for just kiddos and an adult area. If the coordinator can talk a walk and have a face time conversation with you to ease your mind that would be the way to go (like my run on sentence)?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Brides that book a place such as these can enjoy the best of both worlds: They can have family who has kiddos enjoy the just for kids \/ families area while knowing they have an adult only bar or pool area they can relax in while kids are not splashing them. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melisakeltner@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.14.72.31","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1315908384,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245258.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"YS Studios","Id":245258,"Name":"YS Studios","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.152.232.172","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80114,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e22434238c6bc7896ca4dd43979d17b1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"hstuck\" post=\"1914122\" timestamp=\"1464817980\"]\nI am in the process of confirming my Feb 2017 wedding at Sandos Finisterra and wonder if anyone out there has recently have their wedding there or are sometime soon. I don&#039;t have time or budget to do site visits and hoping with this forum and gut feeling things well go well. Let&#039;s become best friends![\/quote]Hello - I am getting married at Sandos Finisterra in February 2017 also.  Have you been able to gather more information from this site? Would love to share!","Attachments":[],"Id":1916811,"PostDate":1480420404,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>hstuck, on 01 June 2016 - 03:53 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I am in the process of confirming my Feb 2017 wedding at Sandos Finisterra and wonder if anyone out there has recently have their wedding there or are sometime soon. I don't have time or budget to do site visits and hoping with this forum and gut feeling things well go well. Let's become best friends!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hello - I am getting married at Sandos Finisterra in February 2017 also. \u00a0Have you been able to gather more information from this site? Would love to share!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cdyanke@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.152.232.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1480420289,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Wiseblueeyes","Id":288096,"Name":"Wiseblueeyes","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"131.107.160.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80114,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a271dadedaf09557dc80919bf47fa321","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m getting married here in 2018. I&#039;d love to see some photos or reviews from you 2017 brides&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917113,"PostDate":1485195644,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm getting married here in 2018. I'd love to see some photos or reviews from you 2017 brides\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"judgeknieriemwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"131.107.160.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1484760722,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"caboboundbride","Id":288331,"Name":"caboboundbride","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
